 "text": "In the town of Emberhollow, third lantern past the fountain, there is a bookshop. It has stood since the Year of the Quiet Comet. Elves spend decades browsing the Arcana section. Dwarves weep quietly in Poetry. Halflings leave crumbs in Cookery, and are forgiven, because they bring scones.",
